<title>USA: Candlewood to raise $50 mln in placement.</title>
<headline>Candlewood to raise $50 mln in placement.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Candlewood Hotel Co Inc said Wednesday it planned to raise about $50 million through a private placement of convertible preferred stock or other equity-link securities.</p>
<p>The company said the deal was expected to close in the third quarter. Net proceeds of the placement were to be used to finance the company's hotel development strategy.</p>
<p>Candlewood is an owner and developer of business extended-stay hotels.</p>
<p>	 -- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
